	(text "VDD33: 3.3V, external (decouple)\nVDD33A: Analog 3.3V, external (decouple with bulk after a ferrite bead)\nVDDIO: 3.3V, external (decouple)\nVREF: 3.3V, external (decouple)\nVBAT: 3.3V, external (decouple)\nVIO18: Internal 1.8V LDO output (decouple with bulk, and treat as net)\nVDD12A: Analog 1.2V, managed internally (decouple with bulk)\nVDDK: Core voltage, managed internally (decouple each pin)"
